sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client SPA
    participant R as ProtectedRoute
    participant A as API
    participant D as MongoDB
    U->>C: register/login
    C->>A: POST /api/auth/register|login
    A->>D: create/find user (username=pending-*)
    A-->>C: {user, token}
    C->>R: navigate to /feed
    R->>R: check localStorage user
    R-->>C: username pending → redirect /onboarding/username (save 'from')
    U->>C: enter username
    C->>A: GET /api/auth/check-username
    A->>D: uniqueness + reserved check
    A-->>C: available
    C->>A: PUT /api/auth/profile {username}
    A->>D: commit username
    C->>R: retry original destination
    R-->>C: State C → render /feed
